      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When moving vertically by playspace it looks like IK is turning off on feets when \"Upright\" parameter gets less than 0.70. There is no state in locomotion layer which such condition so I assume it's hardcoded somewhere internally. Would be great if it's toggleable via state behaviours.",
