      "value": "Would like to add some further feedback on this issue. Since the latest update (which brought great improvements overall such ability to jump without full body) now all my 2.0 avatars completely break when sitting/lying down.\n- For custom animations legs no longer position correctly and move with hmd\n- For avatars with default lying down animation, the hands and hmd are incorrectly offset from controller pos. for some reason.",
